# An allowlist: Go sources, module files, the files they embed (go:embed) and
# the worker's Debian package script. A new embed outside these paths must be
# added here. Exclusions name files (dir/**): a directory already excluded by *
# does not re-exclude them.
*
!**/*.go
!**/go.mod
!**/go.sum
!internal/migrations/**
!internal/media/workqueue/migrations/**
!media/avatar/avatar.png
!cmd/media-worker/debian-snapshot.sh
**/*_test.go
**/testdata/**
**/node_modules/**
benchmarks/**
sdk/**
tests/**
